1070
00:42:07,440 --> 00:42:09,000
you don't benefit from
the drug, and they truly

1071
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:10,330
don't benefit from the drug.

1072
00:42:10,330 --> 00:42:12,330
So this is the way of
