1075
00:42:16,620 --> 00:42:17,995
And it's kind of
like the example

1076
00:42:17,995 --> 00:42:21,720
I talked about before, but
here's a real version of it.

1077
00:42:21,720 --> 00:42:24,095
And you can learn this
